{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Pretty as a lamb and its gentle skin. Blue as a wish and its morbid sin.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A plague wipes out many people's abilities to lie, purifying them\u2014 evolving them. <strong>Or so they say.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">But you? Your body <strong>rots</strong> as you retain your ability to lie. Flee, little bird, flee to the place they whisper of, before they catch your tongue. That castle across the lake, with the long, long bridge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the path you will take\u2014who you might <strong>learn to love</strong>. Choose whether you will<strong> lie</strong>, or tell the<strong> truth</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Oh, and, fragile dove? <u><strong>Beware of the sweet monsters in the night.</strong></u><strong>\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3522410/extras/wishing_flowers.png?t=1749438983\" />Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3a 12K Words (Roughly <strong>one hour</strong> of gameplay).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3a <strong>Re-nameable</strong> heroine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3a DEMO includes the first chapter for<strong> one out of many love interests.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3a <strong>In-game choices</strong> allow players to shape their own paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3a Haunting, original <strong>music</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3a <strong>Sound effects and jump scares!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3a <strong>Lie Count</strong>... So choose carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3a <strong>Two</strong> endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf3a More features <strong>coming soon</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3522410?